 "_doc": "Tier-2 class outfits for Chibi 2 (Thousandvale play-test 4, S18, 2026-10-05). One per class (the 30 Farhold/Emberveil/Thousandvale classes plus the Thousandvale-only Starcaller and Star Blade), complete (every slot), so it never depends on the tier-1 table. Each carries an emblem (`top.emblem`/`emblemColor` on chest and back, `hat.emblem` on the helm brow; ids in avatar-3d/js/chibi2-armour2.js EMBLEM_IDS) and one of the five tier-2 decor kits (t2_pauldrons, t2_mantle, t2_harness, t2_vestments, t2_wildmantle; decor.color2 = trim). `theme`/`set` and the emblem, trim (color2) and glow (emblemColor) follow prototypes/thousandvale/data/rules/armour-tiers.json (stream C/E) so a class preview and a dropped themed piece agree. Read with class-outfits.js loadClassOutfits2(); `dressAs(avatar, t2[cls])` dresses a body; `tier2Dress(look, t2[cls], opts)` lays the tier-2 pieces over a gear-driven look. Every id survives the shared normaliser (tests/class-outfits-t2.test.js). Regenerate with `node tools/build-class-outfits-t2.mjs` (the hand-kept table lives there).",
